{
  "id": "parlour",
  "content": {
    "description": [
      [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "In early 2026, Parlour Caribbean entered a new phase of ownership. Because TSTT’s acquisition did not include the platform’s original visual identity, the transition became an opportunity to develop a new brand for the marketplace."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The rebrand aimed to support a more efficient, Caribbean-centred e-commerce experience, with shorter delivery times for local goods, integrated online payments, and clearer access to authentic regional products worldwide. Three brand directions were presented; the third was selected as primary, with the first held for possible future use. I also designed select MVP pages for the new Parlour site in support of "
            },
            {
              "type": "external-link",
              "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/andelhusbands/",
              "label": "Andel Husbands"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "’s development of the revised digital experience."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    ],
